  "cuts": [
    {
      "id": "scene_0",
      "text": "Imagine you run a massive jungle delivery business.",
      "in_seconds": 0.0,
      "out_seconds": 3.32,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[00-00]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "zoom-in",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/whoosh.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_1",
      "text": "Some days you need to translate complex ancient maps.",
      "in_seconds": 3.7,
      "out_seconds": 6.92,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[00-03]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "pan-left"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_2",
      "text": "Other days you just need to sort mail, or organize banana baskets.",
      "in_seconds": 7.56,
      "out_seconds": 11.12,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[00-07]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_3",
      "text": "For all of this, OpenAI gave us three different monkey helpers in their GPT 5.6 family: Sol, Terra, and Luna.",
      "in_seconds": 11.9,
      "out_seconds": 21.16,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[00-11]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "zoom-out",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/pop.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_4",
      "text": "They all share the exact same memory size, but their brainpower and banana cost are completely different.",
      "in_seconds": 21.82,
      "out_seconds": 27.62,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[00-21]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/notification.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_5",
      "text": "Let\u2019s start with Luna, the speed racer.",
      "in_seconds": 28.36,
      "out_seconds": 31.1,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[00-28]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "zoom-in",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/whoosh.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_6",
      "text": "Luna is like a tiny chimpanzee on a skateboard.",
      "in_seconds": 31.62,
      "out_seconds": 34.4,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[00-31]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "pan-right",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/pop.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_7",
      "text": "She is lightning-fast and works for almost pennies.",
      "in_seconds": 35.0,
      "out_seconds": 37.88,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[00-35]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/chime.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_8",
      "text": "If you need her to quickly categorize incoming emails or detect simple spam, Luna is your go-to.",
      "in_seconds": 38.46,
      "out_seconds": 44.06,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[00-38]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "zoom-out"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_9",
      "text": "But don't ask her to solve a complex coding puzzle.",
      "in_seconds": 44.86,
      "out_seconds": 47.94,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[00-44]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/error.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_10",
      "text": "She'll get confused and drop the ball.",
      "in_seconds": 48.32,
      "out_seconds": 50.1,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[00-48]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/error.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_11",
      "text": "Next is Terra, the balanced worker.",
      "in_seconds": 51.12,
      "out_seconds": 53.44,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[00-51]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "zoom-in",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/whoosh.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_12",
      "text": "Think of Terra as your reliable, everyday assistant monkey.",
      "in_seconds": 53.44,
      "out_seconds": 57.44,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[00-53]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/pop.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_13",
      "text": "Terra is smart enough to handle regular agent workflows, write standard emails, and draft simple blog posts.",
      "in_seconds": 58.2,
      "out_seconds": 64.58,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[00-58]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "pan-left"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_14",
      "text": "She is the middle ground, giving you solid reasoning without costing too many bananas.",
      "in_seconds": 65.04,
      "out_seconds": 69.36,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[01-05]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/chime.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_15",
      "text": "Finally, we have Sol, the grand chieftain of the jungle.",
      "in_seconds": 70.26,
      "out_seconds": 73.84,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[01-10]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "zoom-in",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/whoosh.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_16",
      "text": "Sol is the heavy-lifting gorilla who sits on a throne of books.",
      "in_seconds": 74.58,
      "out_seconds": 78.0,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[01-14]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "ken-burns",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/chime.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_17",
      "text": "Sol is expensive and takes a bit longer to think, but has massive reasoning power.",
      "in_seconds": 78.66,
      "out_seconds": 83.7,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[01-18]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/pop.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_18",
      "text": "If you need to audit security code, design a database, or solve complex logic riddles, Sol is the only one who can do it.",
      "in_seconds": 84.04,
      "out_seconds": 92.1,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[01-24]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "zoom-in",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/notification.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_19",
      "text": "Why not just use Sol for everything?",
      "in_seconds": 92.9,
      "out_seconds": 94.66,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[01-32]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/riser.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_20",
      "text": "Because you'll run out of bananas in minutes!",
      "in_seconds": 95.14,
      "out_seconds": 96.96,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[01-35]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/error.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_21",
      "text": "And why not use Luna for everything?",
      "in_seconds": 97.62,
      "out_seconds": 99.36,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[01-37]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/pop.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_22",
      "text": "Because she isn't smart enough for complex tasks.",
      "in_seconds": 99.76,
      "out_seconds": 102.34,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[01-39]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/error.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_23",
      "text": "Choosing the right tier is all about matching the job to the right brainpower.",
      "in_seconds": 102.98,
      "out_seconds": 106.58,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[01-42]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "zoom-out",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/chime.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_24",
      "text": "So, are you building a high-speed chat widget, a standard automated agent, or a deep analysis tool?",
      "in_seconds": 106.9,
      "out_seconds": 113.58,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[01-46]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "pan-right",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/notification.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_25",
      "text": "Pick the right monkey helper, save your bananas, and build something awesome.",
      "in_seconds": 114.1,
      "out_seconds": 117.78,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[01-54]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "zoom-in",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/pop.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_26",
      "text": "Subscribe for more simple tech breakdowns!",
      "in_seconds": 118.3,
      "out_seconds": 120.36,
      "source": "projects/gpt56_comparison_project_13/images/[01-58]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/ping.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    }
  ],
